{"seq":3,"slug":"landmark-studies","title":"当代哲学里程碑式研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/philosophy/contemporary-philosophy/current-research/landmark-studies","wordCount":3435,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"当代哲学里程碑式研究\">当代哲学里程碑式研究</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>哲学学科的发展并非匀速前进，而是由少数具有变革性的研究成果塑造其走向。这些里程碑式研究之所以重要，不在于它们给出了最终答案，而在于它们改变了提问的方式——重新框架了问题空间，引入了新的概念工具，或者打开了全新的研究方向。本节精选近三十年来五项对当代哲学产生结构性影响的研究纲领，帮助博士研究者理解当前学术格局的形成过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"查尔莫斯与意识研究的重新构架\">查尔莫斯与意识研究的重新构架</h3><p>大卫·查尔莫斯（David Chalmers）在《有意识的心灵》（<em>The Conscious Mind</em>, 1996）中的贡献不仅是提出了&quot;难问题&quot;，更在于他系统地重新构架了意识研究的整个问题空间。</p>\n<p><strong>论证结构</strong>：查尔莫斯的核心论证由三个部分组成。第一，&quot;可设想性论证&quot;（conceivability argument）：物理上与我们完全相同但没有意识体验的&quot;僵尸&quot;（philosophical zombies）在逻辑上是可设想的。第二，如果僵尸是可设想的，那么它们在形而上学上就是可能的（依据一种从可设想性到可能性的推理原则）。第三，如果僵尸在形而上学上是可能的，那么意识就不能完全由物理事实决定——物理主义为假。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可设想性论证</mtext><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Conceivable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>Possible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mtext>Physicalism</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可设想性论证}: \\quad \\text{Conceivable}(Z) \\implies \\text{Possible}(Z) \\implies \\neg \\text{Physicalism}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可设想性论证</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Conceivable</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Possible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Physicalism</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 为哲学僵尸——一个在物理微观结构上与有意识的存在完全相同，但没有任何主观体验的存在。</p>\n<p>这一论证的影响是双重的：它为反物理主义提供了系统的论证框架，同时也激发了物理主义者发展更精细的防御策略。塞缪尔·莱文（Samuel Levine）的&quot;解释鸿沟&quot;（explanatory gap）概念、约瑟夫·莱文（Joseph Levine）的认识论版本，以及约翰·佩里（John Perry）和罗伯特·斯托纳克（Robert Stalnaker）的&quot;现象概念策略&quot;（phenomenal concept strategy）都是对查尔莫斯挑战的直接回应。</p>\n<p><strong>元问题与对齐问题</strong>：查尔莫斯在后续工作中提出了意识的&quot;元问题&quot;（meta-problem of consciousness）：为什么我们会认为存在意识的难问题？即便我们无法解决难问题本身，解释为什么我们有关于难问题的直觉也是一个重要的（且可能可解的）问题。这一策略体现了哲学中常见的&quot;升阶&quot;方法——当一阶问题陷入僵局时，转向对该僵局本身的分析。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[查尔莫斯 1996] --&gt; B[意识难问题]&#10;    A --&gt; C[僵尸论证]&#10;    A --&gt; D[意识的元问题]&#10;    B --&gt; E[物理主义防御]&#10;    B --&gt; F[反物理主义替代]&#10;    C --&gt; G[可设想性-可能性原则争论]&#10;    E --&gt; H[现象概念策略&lt;br/&gt;Perry, Stalnaker]&#10;    E --&gt; I[Type-B 物理主义&lt;br/&gt;Block, Papineau]&#10;    F --&gt; J[泛心论&lt;br/&gt;Goff, Strawson]&#10;    F --&gt; K[罗素一元论&lt;br/&gt;Russell, Chalmers]&#10;    D --&gt; L[解释鸿沟的认识论化]\">graph TB\n    A[查尔莫斯 1996] --&gt; B[意识难问题]\n    A --&gt; C[僵尸论证]\n    A --&gt; D[意识的元问题]\n    B --&gt; E[物理主义防御]\n    B --&gt; F[反物理主义替代]\n    C --&gt; G[可设想性-可能性原则争论]\n    E --&gt; H[现象概念策略&lt;br/&gt;Perry, Stalnaker]\n    E --&gt; I[Type-B 物理主义&lt;br/&gt;Block, Papineau]\n    F --&gt; J[泛心论&lt;br/&gt;Goff, Strawson]\n    F --&gt; K[罗素一元论&lt;br/&gt;Russell, Chalmers]\n    D --&gt; L[解释鸿沟的认识论化]</pre><h3 id=\"托诺尼的整合信息理论\">托诺尼的整合信息理论</h3><p>朱利奥·托诺尼（Giulio Tononi）的整合信息理论（Integrated Information Theory, IIT）是近二十年来最具雄心的意识理论之一，它试图从数学第一原理出发推导意识的结构。</p>\n<p><strong>公理化方法</strong>：IIT的独特之处在于其公理化方法。它从意识的现象学特征出发，提出五个公理（axioms）：(1) 内在存在性（intrinsic existence）——意识从经历者自身的视角存在；(2) 组合性（composition）——每一个体验都由多个可区分的方面组成；(3) 信息性（information）——每一个体验都是特定的，与其他可能的体验不同；(4) 整合性（integration）——每一个体验是统一的，不可还原为独立的部分；(5) 排他性（exclusion）——每一个体验在空间和时间尺度上是确定的。</p>\n<p>从这些公理出发，IIT推导出衡量意识的核心量——整合信息 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mtext>partition</mtext></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi = \\min_{\\text{partition}} \\left[ D(p(X^t | X^{t-1}) \\| \\prod_k p(M_k^t | M_k^{t-1})) \\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3665em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">partition</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8696em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4086em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2914em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 为系统状态，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为划分后的各部分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为某种信息距离度量。直觉上，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量的是系统作为整体所携带的超出其部分之和的信息量。</p>\n<p><strong>哲学意义</strong>：IIT具有几个重要的哲学后果。首先，它是一种泛心论——任何具有非零 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span></span></span></span></span> 的系统（包括简单的物理系统）都具有某种程度的意识。其次，它预测标准的冯·诺依曼计算机架构具有极低的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span></span></span></span></span>，因此即使是非常复杂的计算机也几乎没有意识——这与功能主义的直觉相矛盾。第三，它提供了意识的&quot;数学结构&quot;理论，有潜力弥合解释鸿沟。</p>\n<p><strong>批评与争议</strong>：IIT面临的主要批评包括：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span></span></span></span></span> 的计算在复杂系统中是不可行的（计算复杂度随系统规模指数增长）；其泛心论后果是否可接受存在争议；排他性公理是否有充分的现象学基础也受到质疑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"弗里斯顿的自由能原理\">弗里斯顿的自由能原理</h3><p>卡尔·弗里斯顿（Karl Friston）的自由能原理（Free Energy Principle, FEP）最初是一个神经科学理论，但其哲学含义日益受到关注，已经成为心灵哲学、认识论和生物哲学讨论的重要焦点。</p>\n<p><strong>核心框架</strong>：自由能原理主张，任何自我组织的系统（从单细胞到人类大脑）都可以被理解为在最小化其&quot;变分自由能&quot;（variational free energy）——一个衡量系统内部模型与外部环境之间偏差的信息论量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = D_{\\text{KL}}[q(\\theta) \\| p(\\theta | o)] - \\ln p(o) \\geq -\\ln p(o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为系统对隐变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 的近似后验分布，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\theta | o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为给定观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 的真实后验分布，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{KL}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为KL散度。最小化自由能等价于最小化两件事：(1) 模型与环境的偏差（信念精确化）；(2) 意外性（通过主动推理改变环境以符合预期）。</p>\n<p><strong>主动推理</strong>：弗里斯顿提出的&quot;主动推理&quot;（active inference）框架将知觉、行动和学习统一在同一个数学框架下。有机体不仅被动地更新其对世界的信念（感知推理），还通过行动改变世界使之符合预期（主动推理）。这一框架对行动哲学和实用主义认识论有深刻启示。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[自由能原理&lt;br/&gt;Friston] --&gt; B[感知推理&lt;br/&gt;信念更新]&#10;    A --&gt; C[主动推理&lt;br/&gt;行动选择]&#10;    A --&gt; D[学习&lt;br/&gt;模型更新]&#10;    B --&gt; E[预测编码&lt;br/&gt;Predictive Coding]&#10;    C --&gt; F[行动哲学&lt;br/&gt;实用主义]&#10;    D --&gt; G[认识论&lt;br/&gt;模型选择]&#10;    A --&gt; H[生命与心灵的统一]&#10;    H --&gt; I[马尔可夫毯&lt;br/&gt;Markov Blanket]&#10;    I --&gt; J[自我边界问题]&#10;    J --&gt; K[延展心灵争论]\">graph LR\n    A[自由能原理&lt;br/&gt;Friston] --&gt; B[感知推理&lt;br/&gt;信念更新]\n    A --&gt; C[主动推理&lt;br/&gt;行动选择]\n    A --&gt; D[学习&lt;br/&gt;模型更新]\n    B --&gt; E[预测编码&lt;br/&gt;Predictive Coding]\n    C --&gt; F[行动哲学&lt;br/&gt;实用主义]\n    D --&gt; G[认识论&lt;br/&gt;模型选择]\n    A --&gt; H[生命与心灵的统一]\n    H --&gt; I[马尔可夫毯&lt;br/&gt;Markov Blanket]\n    I --&gt; J[自我边界问题]\n    J --&gt; K[延展心灵争论]</pre><p><strong>哲学争议</strong>：自由能原理的哲学争议集中在以下几点：(1) 它是否过于一般化——如果所有自我组织的系统都在最小化自由能，这一原理是否有实质性的经验内容，还是仅仅是一个分析性的重述？(2) &quot;马尔可夫毯&quot;（Markov blanket）概念是否能成功地定义系统与环境的边界？这一问题直接关系到自我、主体性和延展心灵等哲学议题。(3) 自由能原理是否蕴含了一种新型的目的论——有机体的行为可以被理解为朝向某种&quot;目标&quot;（最小化自由能），而无需诉诸传统的意向性概念。</p>\n<h3 id=\"塞尔的社会本体论\">塞尔的社会本体论</h3><p>约翰·塞尔（John Searle）在《社会实在的建构》（<em>The Construction of Social Reality</em>, 1995）和《制造社会世界》（<em>Making the Social World</em>, 2010）中发展的社会本体论，为理解制度性事实（institutional facts）提供了一个系统框架。</p>\n<p><strong>核心公式</strong>：塞尔将制度性事实的结构概括为&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 在语境 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 中算作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;的公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mi>C</mi></mpadded></mover><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X \\xrightarrow{C} Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如，一张特定的纸（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>）在美国联邦储备系统的语境中（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）算作货币（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>）。制度性事实的独特之处在于，它们的存在依赖于集体接受（collective acceptance）——如果所有人都不再接受某张纸是货币，它就不再是货币。</p>\n<p><strong>地位功能</strong>：塞尔论证，制度性事实通过&quot;地位功能&quot;（status functions）的赋予来创建。地位功能不是由对象的物理属性决定的，而是由集体的意向性赋予的。总统、婚姻、财产权、大学学位——这些都是通过集体赋予地位功能而存在的社会事实。</p>\n<p><strong>集体意向性</strong>：塞尔的社会本体论建立在集体意向性（collective intentionality）的概念之上。集体意向性不可还原为个体意向性之和——&quot;我们打算做X&quot;不等于&quot;我打算做X且你打算做X&quot;。这一主张在社会科学哲学和政治哲学中引发了广泛讨论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"帕菲特的-论重要之事\">帕菲特的《论重要之事》</h3><p>德里克·帕菲特（Derek Parfit）的遗作《论重要之事》（<em>On What Matters</em>, 2011, 2017三卷本）是二十一世纪初最具影响力的伦理学著作之一。</p>\n<p><strong>三元融合论</strong>：帕菲特的核心论题是：康德主义（Kantianism）、后果主义（consequentialism）和斯坎伦式契约论（Scanlonian contractualism）这三种看似对立的伦理理论，在经过恰当的修正和重新表述之后，实际上是&quot;同一座山的不同侧面&quot;——它们在核心规范性主张上趋于一致。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Triple Theory</mtext><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>K</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Triple Theory}: \\quad K \\cap C \\cap S \\neq \\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Triple Theory</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∅</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 为康德主义允许的行为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为后果主义允许的行为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为契约论允许的行为集合。帕菲特论证这三个集合的交集覆盖了绝大多数道德上重要的情境。</p>\n<p><strong>对元伦理学的贡献</strong>：帕菲特在第二卷和第三卷中发展了一种&quot;非自然主义认知主义&quot;（non-naturalist cognitivism）立场：道德事实是客观的、不可还原为自然事实的，但我们可以通过理性反思来认识它们。这一立场与马切洛·戈麦斯-洛特瓦特（Mackie）的&quot;错误论&quot;和布莱克本的准实在论形成了鲜明对比。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[帕菲特&lt;br/&gt;On What Matters] --&gt; B[三元融合论]&#10;    A --&gt; C[非自然主义认知主义]&#10;    B --&gt; D[康德主义修正]&#10;    B --&gt; E[后果主义修正]&#10;    B --&gt; F[契约论修正&lt;br/&gt;Scanlon]&#10;    C --&gt; G[反错误论]&#10;    C --&gt; H[反准实在论]&#10;    D --&gt; I[融合区域&lt;br/&gt;核心规范性共识]&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; J[道德实在论的复兴]&#10;    H --&gt; J\">graph TB\n    A[帕菲特&lt;br/&gt;On What Matters] --&gt; B[三元融合论]\n    A --&gt; C[非自然主义认知主义]\n    B --&gt; D[康德主义修正]\n    B --&gt; E[后果主义修正]\n    B --&gt; F[契约论修正&lt;br/&gt;Scanlon]\n    C --&gt; G[反错误论]\n    C --&gt; H[反准实在论]\n    D --&gt; I[融合区域&lt;br/&gt;核心规范性共识]\n    E --&gt; I\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; J[道德实在论的复兴]\n    H --&gt; J</pre><p><strong>批评与遗产</strong>：帕菲特的融合论遭到了来自各方的批评。康德主义者认为帕菲特对康德的重构扭曲了康德的核心主张；后果主义者质疑融合是否仅仅是因为帕菲特选择性地解读了三种理论。然而，《论重要之事》的影响是不可否认的——它重新开启了关于伦理理论统一性的讨论，并提升了元伦理学中非自然主义立场的学术地位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>查尔莫斯的可设想性论证依赖于&quot;可设想性蕴含形而上学可能性&quot;这一原则。但这一原则是否可靠？请讨论至少两种质疑这一原则的策略（如先验物理主义、类型-B物理主义），并评估它们的说服力。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>整合信息理论（IIT）预测标准计算机具有极低的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span></span></span></span></span>，因此几乎没有意识。但如果一个系统的行为与有意识的人类在所有功能维度上不可区分，我们是否仍然应该否认它有意识？IIT的预测是否构成了对该理论的反驳？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>自由能原理主张所有自我组织的系统都在最小化变分自由能。但&quot;所有&quot;系统都适用的原理是否有经验内容？请用波普尔的可证伪性标准来评估自由能原理的科学地位。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>塞尔主张集体意向性不可还原为个体意向性之和。但在什么意义上&quot;我们打算做X&quot;不等于个体意图的组合？请构造一个具体的例子来支持或反驳塞尔的论点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>帕菲特的&quot;三元融合论&quot;声称康德主义、后果主义和契约论趋于一致。但在实际的道德困境中（如电车难题的各种变体），三种理论是否真的给出相同的判断？请设计一个三种理论给出不同判断的案例，并讨论这对融合论的挑战。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Chalmers, D. (1996). <em>The Conscious Mind</em>. Oxford University Press. 意识难问题和僵尸论证的原始论述。</li>\n<li>Tononi, G. (2012). <em>Phi: A Voyage from the Brain to the Soul</em>. Pantheon. 整合信息理论的通俗版介绍。</li>\n<li>Tononi, G. et al. (2016). &quot;Integrated Information Theory: From Consciousness to Its Physical Substrate.&quot; <em>Nature Reviews Neuroscience</em>, 17, 450-461. IIT 3.0的技术综述。</li>\n<li>Friston, K. (2010). &quot;The Free-Energy Principle: A Unified Brain Theory?&quot; <em>Nature Reviews Neuroscience</em>, 11(2), 127-138. 自由能原理的经典综述。</li>\n<li>Searle, J. (1995). <em>The Construction of Social Reality</em>. Free Press. 社会本体论的奠基之作。</li>\n<li>Parfit, D. (2011). <em>On What Matters</em> (Vol. 1 &amp; 2). Oxford University Press. 三元融合论与元伦理学。</li>\n<li>Hohwy, J. (2013). <em>The Predictive Mind</em>. Oxford University Press. 预测编码与自由能原理的哲学解读。</li>\n<li>Singer, P. (Ed.) (2016). <em>Does Anything Really Matter? Essays on Parfit on Objectivity</em>. Oxford University Press. 对帕菲特元伦理学立场的系统回应。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本节考察的五项里程碑式研究——查尔莫斯对意识问题的重新构架、托诺尼的整合信息理论、弗里斯顿的自由能原理、塞尔的社会本体论和帕菲特的伦理学融合论——共同塑造了当代哲学的问题版图。它们的共同特征是：不满足于在既有框架内进行增量推进，而是试图重新定义问题本身。查尔莫斯改变了我们提问意识问题的方式，托诺尼提供了意识研究的数学框架，弗里斯顿统一了知觉与行动的哲学分析，塞尔澄清了社会实在的本体论结构，帕菲特试图弥合伦理理论之间看似不可调和的鸿沟。博士研究者从这些工作中可以学到的，不仅是具体的论证和概念，更是一种研究的勇气——敢于质疑既有框架，敢于提出新的概念工具。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"当代哲学里程碑式研究","id":"当代哲学里程碑式研究"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"查尔莫斯与意识研究的重新构架","id":"查尔莫斯与意识研究的重新构架"},{"level":3,"text":"托诺尼的整合信息理论","id":"托诺尼的整合信息理论"},{"level":3,"text":"弗里斯顿的自由能原理","id":"弗里斯顿的自由能原理"},{"level":3,"text":"塞尔的社会本体论","id":"塞尔的社会本体论"},{"level":3,"text":"帕菲特的《论重要之事》","id":"帕菲特的-论重要之事"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"当代哲学新兴方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/philosophy/contemporary-philosophy/current-research/emerging-methodologies"},"next":{"title":"当代哲学的开放问题","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/philosophy/contemporary-philosophy/future-directions/open-problems"}}